{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15232040","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15232040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:3:1523203001:":{"text":"停戦協定はホーリンを獣人の支配下に置くものだ。","source_cn":"停战合约令呼临受制于兽人","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3918308A2F661331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1523203002:":{"text":"野獣どもに屈するなど言語道断！","source_cn":"呼临怎可向野兽卑躬屈膝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02CCFA0743E71925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1523203003:":{"text":"この協定は破棄せねばならん！","source_cn":"必须撕毁合约！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C89A67903D233B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1523203004:":{"text":"破棄！破棄！","source_cn":"撕毁合约！撕毁合约！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FD6AE42C71210F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1523203004:timeline_repeat_1":{"text":"破棄！破棄！","source_cn":"撕毁合约！撕毁合约！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FD6AE42C71210F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1523203005:":{"text":"アウレリン！","source_cn":"奥勒留！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD503AED5E4039AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1523204001:0":{"text":"アウレリン！自分が何をしてるか、分かっているのか！？","source_cn":"奥勒留！你知道你在干什么吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12B91922A344942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1523204002:1":{"text":"ヘルンニ殿下がお前に高位と厚遇を授けたのは、若きアバルド殿下を補佐させるため。そんな彼の決断に反旗を翻すとは、何たる裏切りか！","source_cn":"赫伦尼殿下许给你高官厚禄，是为了让你辅佐阿邦德殿下，为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9443E00F842CF72E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1523204003:1":{"text":"ビルボ、お前の頭はいつからそんなに鈍くなったんだ？","source_cn":"比博，你的脑袋里是什么时候灌满了泥浆？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x121CEBC6E536ECD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1523204004:1":{"text":"殿下は独断で獣人と屈辱的な協定を結び、ホーリンに不利益を被った。私がそれを正しているのではないか。","source_cn":"领主殿下一意孤行，与兽人签下耻辱的合约，损害呼临的利益...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7DE9836C8A5D23D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1523204005:1":{"text":"その決断がどれほど危ういことか、私一人が言っても耳を貸さないなら、民意であると分からせる